  "prompt": "One single heavy downward club smash toward screen right. Compress into the crouch, raise only the club arm over the shoulder while keeping the huge head low, then drive the club sharply down in one decisive arc with a brief impact accent and minimal motion trail. The body jolts with the impact, free claw catches its weight, and the short bent legs stay low. No second swing or combo, no jumping or upright stance. Lift the club back and recover to the exact original hunched pose at the same ground location. Torn cloth follows the motion and settles. Fixed camera, full figure visible.",
